                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The hunter is holding a ranged weapon and their prey is within their first range increment</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The strix hunter sings out, calling for a tandem attack. The strix hunter makes a ranged Strike against their prey, and a single ally within 30 feet can use their reaction to make a Strike against the same target. If both attacks hit, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the start of the hunter's next turn.</p>"
                },
