        {
            "_id": "FTy2GhfGUmkI2KDt",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Stalk Prey",
            "sort": 1100000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The strix hunter designates a single creature they can see and hear, or one they're Tracking, as their prey. The hunter gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to [[/act seek]] the prey and to Survival checks to [[/act track]] the prey. The first time the hunter hits their prey in a round, they deal an additional 1d8 precision damage. These effects last until the hunter uses Stalk Prey again.</p>"
                },
